# Front requires no environment variables.
# The browser always calls the relative, same-origin /api/v1 prefix.
# Vite proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:3001 during development.
# Configure APP_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173 on the backend for Vite.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL overrides are not supported.
# Never place database passwords or AI provider keys in Front or VITE_* variables.
